  "description": "*\"I should be in the hospital...?\"*\n\nSe-Ri wakes up from a car accident to find herself a celebrity on the verge of retirement.\n\n *\"What did I do? Why does everyone hate me!!!\"*\n\nThere are mountains of misunderstandings Se-Ri has to resolve. And Jeong-Min, who spent his childhood with Se-Ri, has become a successful actor in the entertainment industry. One day, Jeong-Min comes to her and suggests that they film a program together... Thanks to Jeong-Min's fame, the two of them keep rising in the real-time search rankings.\n\nThe relationship between us is familiar yet unfamiliar, close yet distant...?!\n\n(Source: Comico, translated)",
